title: "The seven-dimensional kissing number under irreducible symmetry is 126"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Proves that seven-dimensional kissing configurations with irreducible orthogonal symmetry have at most 126 points, attained by E7. Point transitivity is not assumed. The archive includes dependent proofs and independent exact verification, and does not settle the unrestricted problem."
